I STILL HAD FUCKING SWIM PRACTICE. 🏊‍♂️💀

BROOOOOOO.

THERE WAS NO WAY I WAS JUMPING INTO THAT POOL WITH A FULLY LOADED CHOCOLATE SUBMARINE SITTING IN MY INTESTINES.

IMAGINE DOING A 200 BUTTERFLY WHILE YOUR ASSHOLE IS SECRETLY PREPARING A BROWN PEARL HARBOR.

ABSOLUTELY FUCKING NOT. 😭

SO I MADE A DECISION.

EMERGENCY PRE-WORKOUT EVACUATION. 🚽🚨

I STORMED INTO THE TRAINING FACILITY BATHROOM LIKE A SOLDIER ENTERING ENEMY TERRITORY.

NO TIME FOR ROMANCE.

NO TIME FOR A FIVE-STAR PORCELAIN SPA EXPERIENCE.

JUST ME, MY PUB SUB, AND A DESPERATE ATTEMPT TO EMPTY EVERY LAST CHOCOLATE SOLDIER BEFORE COACH BLOWS THE WHISTLE. 🫡💩

I SAT DOWN.

I BRACED MYSELF.

AND I TRIED TO CONVINCE MY INTESTINES TO CLOCK OUT EARLY.

COME ON, YOU LITTLE BROWN BASTARDS! WE HAVE PRACTICE TO ATTEND! 😭

But my stomach was still processing an entire American sandwich empire.

The pressure was ON.

The clock was TICKING.

And somewhere outside that bathroom, my teammates were preparing to swim while I was conducting a FULL-SCALE DIGESTIVE MILITARY OPERATION.

FINAL VERDICT:

🥪 Pub Sub: ABSOLUTELY DEMOLISHED.

🚽 Location: TRAINING FACILITY BATTLEFIELD.

