THE LOCATION?

📍 WEST PALM BEACH SERVICE PLAZA, FLORIDA.

THE WEAPON?

🥪 MY SECOND FUCKING PUBLIX SUB FROM YESTERDAY.

THE SUPPORTING CAST?

🚬 NICOTINE POUCHES AND MY TRUSTY VAPE.

THE MISSION?

OPERATION BROWN INTERSTATE FREEDOM. 🇺🇸🦅

BROOOOOOOOO.

After absolutely DEMOLISHING the second half of my legendary Pub Sub supply, my intestines apparently decided it was time to file a MASSIVE FUCKING DELIVERY ORDER.

Somewhere along the Florida highway, the chocolate factory started rumbling.

THE PRESSURE WAS BUILDING.

THE ANACONDA WAS AWAKENING.

AND MY ASSHOLE WAS ABOUT TO BECOME A TOURIST ATTRACTION. 🐍😭

I entered that service plaza bathroom like a weary Viking warrior returning from battle.

I SAT UPON THE PORCELAIN THRONE.

AND THEN…

PLOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOP. 💩💥

HOLY. MOTHERFUCKING. JESUS.

OUT CAME A MAGNIFICENT, THICK, GLORIOUS BROWN ANACONDA.

NOT A RABBIT PELLET.

NOT A KANGAROO FETUS.

NOT A DISAPPOINTING LITTLE COCKTAIL SAUSAGE.

A FULL-GROWN AMAZONIAN CHOCOLATE SERPENT. 🐍🍫

