“Here, in the wild restrooms of South Florida, we witness the rare Swedish Chocolate Anaconda emerging from its natural habitat.” 🎥🌴

AND THE RELIEF?!

ABSOLUTELY FUCKING BEAUTIFUL. 😩✨

A proper, satisfying, highway-approved bowel movement.

No unnecessary drama.

No emergency evacuation.

JUST A BEAUTIFUL BROWN SUBMARINE REACHING ITS FINAL DESTINATION.

For one glorious moment, I forgot about the highway, the traffic, the endless American service stations…

IT WAS JUST ME, MY ANACONDA, AND THE PORCELAIN KINGDOM. 👑🚽

FINAL VERDICT:

📍 Location: WEST PALM BEACH SERVICE PLAZA.

🥪 Pub Sub consumption: ROUND TWO COMPLETED.

🐍 Poop size: FULL-GROWN CHOCOLATE ANACONDA.

💩 Release satisfaction: HIGHWAY HEAVEN.

🚬 Nicotine involvement: QUESTIONABLE SUPPORTING ACTOR.

🚽 Pitstop quality: LEGENDARY.

🍑 Asshole morale: BACK IN BUSINESS.

🏆 LordOfTheLogs4: THE KING IS COMING FOR YOUR CROWN.

SOME PEOPLE LEAVE THEIR MARK ON HISTORY.

I LEFT MINE AT A FUCKING SERVICE PLAZA IN WEST PALM BEACH. 🇺🇸💩

