BROOOOOOOOO.

THIS LITTLE BASTARD HAD APPARENTLY SURVIVED AN ENTIRE JOURNEY THROUGH MY DIGESTIVE SYSTEM AND DECIDED TO MAKE ITS GRAND EXIT DURING MY MORNING SHIT.

A TRUE SURVIVOR.

A SWEDISH NICOTINE ASTRONAUT RETURNING FROM THE DEPTHS OF THE CHOCOLATE GALAXY. 🚀💩

