AND THE RELEASE?!

PRETTY FUCKING NICE. 😩✨

A comfortable little pressure sensation, a smooth delivery, and that beautiful post-workout relief that makes you feel like you’ve finally completed the last event of a swimming competition.

My hemorrhoids did complain a little, itching like angry little bastards demanding better working conditions.

BUT OTHERWISE?!

NOT BAD AT ALL.

No fireworks. No spiritual awakening. No standing ovation from the heavens.

JUST A NICE, HONEST, HARDWORKING MORNING SHIT.

FINAL VERDICT:

🏊‍♂️ Morning swim practice: ABSOLUTE HELL.

