Forget multiple-choice questions.

Forget essays.

Forget academic pressure.

THE ONLY TEST THAT MATTERED WAS WAITING INSIDE THE DISABLED BATHROOM AT ST. THOMAS UNIVERSITY.

I ENTERED THE PORCELAIN KINGDOM READY TO CELEBRATE MY ACADEMIC SURVIVAL.

AND THEN…

PLOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOP. 💩💥

HOLY MOTHER OF JESUS.

OUT CAME A MASSIVE, THICK, GLORIOUS CHOCOLATE KILLER SLUG. 🐌🍫

NOT A RABBIT PELLET.

NOT A PATHETIC COCKTAIL SAUSAGE.

NOT TWO MUTANT TADPOLES WITH TESTICLES.

A FULL-GROWN FUCKING MURDER SLUG FROM THE DEPTHS OF THE SWEDISH CHOCOLATE JUNGLE. 🇸🇪🌴

I ALMOST EXPECTED IT TO CRAWL OUT OF THE TOILET AND ASK FOR ITS OWN STUDENT ID.

BUT THEN…

THE HORROR BEGAN. 🚨

BECAUSE LET’S TALK ABOUT AMERICAN PUBLIC BATHROOMS.

WHAT. THE. ACTUAL. FUCK. 🇺🇸😭

