NONEXISTENT. 💀

WHY DO AMERICAN PUBLIC TOILETS HAVE MORE GAPS THAN MY KNOWLEDGE DURING A FUCKING MIDTERM?!

BROOOOOOO.

I’M TRYING TO ENJOY A PEACEFUL, INTIMATE MOMENT WITH MY CHOCOLATE ANACONDA.

BUT EVERY LITTLE SOUND ECHOES THROUGH THE ENTIRE FUCKING BATHROOM.

PLOP!

Echo… echo… echo…

PRRRRRT!

Echo… echo… echo…

IT SOUNDED LIKE MY ASSHOLE WAS PERFORMING A LIVE CONCERT INSIDE A FUCKING CATHEDRAL. ⛪🎤

I DIDN’T ASK FOR AN AUDIENCE.

I DIDN’T ASK FOR SURROUND SOUND.

I JUST WANT TO SHIT IN FUCKING PEACE! 😭🍑

