AFTER ABSOLUTELY FUCKING DEMOLISHING PANDA EXPRESS, I WAS EXPECTING SOMETHING LEGENDARY.

A CHOCOLATE DRAGON. 🐉

A GENERAL TSO’S NUCLEAR MISSILE. 🚀

A MASSIVE ORANGE CHICKEN-POWERED ANACONDA. 🍊🐍

BUT NO.

ONE. FUCKING. BALL. 🟤

THAT’S IT.

THAT’S THE WHOLE FUCKING REVIEW.

BROOOOOOOOOOOOOOO. 😭😭😭

I SAT DOWN ON MY PORCELAIN THRONE WITH THE CONFIDENCE OF A MAN WHO HAD JUST CONSUMED ENOUGH CHINESE-AMERICAN FOOD TO FEED AN ENTIRE SWIMMING TEAM.

MY STOMACH WAS FULL.

MY EXPECTATIONS WERE HIGH.

MY ASSHOLE WAS READY FOR THE PERFORMANCE OF A LIFETIME.

I CLOSED MY EYES.

I WAITED FOR THE MAGIC.

AND THEN…

…plip.

A SINGLE, LONELY, PATHETIC LITTLE CHOCOLATE PEBBLE. 🥺💩

IT LOOKED LIKE A FUCKING RAISIN THAT HAD LOST ITS WILL TO LIVE.

A SAD LITTLE BROWN PLANET FLOATING ALONE IN AN ENDLESS PORCELAIN UNIVERSE. 🪐

I STARED INTO THE TOILET.

THE TOILET STARED BACK.

WE WERE BOTH DISAPPOINTED.

WHERE THE FUCK IS THE REST OF MY PANDA EXPRESS?! 🐼😭

I PAID FOR A FULL CHINESE BUFFET EXPERIENCE AND MY CHOCOLATE FACTORY DELIVERED A FUCKING FREE SAMPLE.

NOT EVEN A COCKTAIL SAUSAGE.

NOT EVEN A MUTANT TADPOLE.

A SINGLE CHOCOLATE M&M WITHOUT THE M.

SOMEWHERE IN THE DISTANCE, LORDOFTHELOGS4 WAS PROBABLY LAUGHING HIS ASS OFF.

MY FANS DESERVED BETTER.

MY ANCESTORS DESERVED BETTER.

THE PANDA ON THE RESTAURANT LOGO DESERVED BETTER. 🐼💔

AND THE WORST PART?!

AFTER ALL THAT FOOD, I KNOW THE REAL MONSTER IS STILL OUT THERE.

SOMEWHERE.

WAITING.

PLOTTING.

PREPARING ITS NEXT ATTACK.

BUT TONIGHT?

THE CHOCOLATE FACTORY HAS OFFICIALLY FILED FOR BANKRUPTCY. 📉🏭

FINAL VERDICT:

🐼 Panda Express meal: ABSOLUTELY FUCKING BEAUTIFUL.

🍊 Expectations: ORANGE CHICKEN TSUNAMI.

🟤 Actual production: ONE DEPRESSED CHOCOLATE MARBLE.

💩 Quantity: 0.00001 ANACONDAS.

🍑 Release satisfaction: EMOTIONALLY DEVASTATING.

🏭 Chocolate factory: CLOSED DUE TO LACK OF INVENTORY.

😭 Disappointment: 11/10.

🏆 PoopMe historical significance: THE GREAT PANDA EXPRESS BETRAYAL.

I CAME EXPECTING A CHINESE DRAGON.

I LEFT WITH A FUCKING DRAGON EGG. 🐉🥚

PANDA EXPRESS… EXPLAIN YOURSELF. 😭🐼💩',NULL,'shithole',1,NULL,7477211,4164186);
