INSERT INTO "poop" VALUES(252531919,'2026-10-30T03:13:29.651Z',0.0,0.0,0,'apparently on my second day of the internship like almost 2 months ago, I messed up line work on a CAD file and it cost the company $2K in fixes??! but idek if it is completely my fault cuz my trainer or team is supposed to review everything I do before submission, and that was my second day LOL. it’s very bizarre how emotionally resilient my last job got me tho. like if I messed up a tiny TINY thing or took too long, my boss would call me a fucking retard and throw shit around and curse at me. don’t get me wrong, I feel bad for losing company money but it’s also SUPER funny how chill the office space is because there’s actually an HR that will protect me somewhat?? I kind of just laughed it off because no one was stern with me at all. and on top of that, I had to get a $100 reimbursement from my supervisor, and he’s the one that threatened to write me up then backed off. I didn’t gaf, just walked in there and asked for my hundred dollars even tho I should be paying $1900 😹😹😹. my feelings are either solidified af or numb as shit from my last job. can’t tell',NULL,'',1,NULL,393818,NULL);
