INSERT INTO "poop" VALUES(252616201,'2026-10-31T03:43:05.383Z',-37.804278642470933,144.94909308850771,0,'reflective pooping. i journaled and reflected on past few days because i forgot to—few things happened. hang outs, interactions, and side quests. i went to a party last night as eggs. my closest friend dressed up as wirt and i regret not sticking with greg…oh well. i’m still very happy she could come to the party. it was a weird one last night. i think the venue contributed to the weirdness; it was a bar with icky lighting and strangers kept going through the room to go to the bathroom. got misgendered by friends i consider quite close to me. i just kept hovering around and kinda occupied that in-between space. i shouldve talked to that person whom i think was also in a similar space, i couldve brought up the dark version of alice in wonderland bc she was alice and we couldve talked about movies and other stuff. but i still had a lot of fun and i lingered till the end, thats why im feeling mixed up about the function. i walked home alone and didnt take my costume off until i got to my room. people and strangers complimented my costume but only few recognised it lol shout out bartender who poured me wet pussy shot, genuinely made my whole night. i wish i could just walk around everyday with a box covering my torso and chest. and i wish i could be perceived as movie characters even if its not halloween.',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,6218397,2158177);
