INSERT INTO "poop" VALUES(252619774,'2026-10-31T06:25:29.068Z',44.864522970168864,0.79845439642667782,0,'3:40 AM had a huge poop. Also saw ghost of my mother. in this plastic chair when I went to go have a cigarette.. I know my eyes playing tricks on me but fucking scared the shit out of me. Because after 10 days, but my mom sitting in the morgue even after they did her up, you know like put stuff in her face to make her look human again, she still look like a witch. Super pointy Knows. I saw her yesterday that’s why I’m talking about this. In her coffin. intuitively that was a bad idea to look at her, but I did anyway, and I regret it. All morning I’ve been trying to look at her photos of her so I remember those photos not the one I saw in real life. I miss my mom. Life really sucks right now. I do not know how to explain it. I’m still in shock! Like my dad she was too young to die. Both my parents were workaholics. And they only got to enjoy their Social Security for two years each. All that lifetime of paying into Social Security was just a waste. because they take that money back as soon as you die. Anyways, that’s a different gripe. 
