INSERT INTO "poop" VALUES(252629660,'2026-10-31T10:29:46.938Z',60.422239331075929,5.3062254935503006,0,'walan woi, this shit legit damn satisfying. i was chopping bell peppers then halfway thru i felt the shit feeling but it wasnt urgent. then at one point in time it suddenly became abit pain so i knew i had to go shit. so i faster take my phone and go back my room and while i was doing that the pain intensified. i quickly dropped my pants and underwear and sat down and the first 1 to 2 shits that came out was abit constipated becus it required abit of push for it to come out but i think its becus i was holding it in for awhile so it jammed at the customs. but after the first 2 shits came out, everything else flowed out nicely. and it wasnt even diarhaea or anything, it was good colour good shape good hardness. and the amount that came out was quite alot ah. ngl i was very tempted to take a pic of it but i shall not la. and once it came out the instant relief was so satisfying, i think if i weigh myself now i would be down a few kg from yesterday cfm. u know what, let me call rachel now to go down to use the weighing machine',NULL,'hatleberg',5,NULL,7367361,3158616);
